{"seq":2,"slug":"quality-filtering","title":"质量过滤：从启发式到模型打分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/pretraining-data-engineering/cleaning-filtering/quality-filtering","wordCount":1833,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"质量过滤-从启发式到模型打分\">质量过滤：从启发式到模型打分</h1><p>FineWeb-Edu 的做法在两年前还像天方夜谭：先用大模型给几十万网页的&quot;教育价值&quot;打 0 到 100 分，再训练一个小分类器学会这套评分，最后把 15 万亿 token 砍剩 1.3 万亿——被扔掉的九成文本换来了 MMLU 与 ARC 上的显著跃升（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.17557\">FineWeb</a>）。质量过滤由此完成了从&quot;正则表达式手册&quot;到&quot;用模型为模型选数据&quot;的范式转移，但每一代方法都带着自己特有的盲区。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>所有质量过滤器都在回答同一个问题：这篇文档值得占据训练预算吗？区别只在判定信号的来源。按信号成本与判别力递增，可以排成一条四级阶梯：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;候选文档&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;L1 手工启发式&lt;br/&gt;长度 / 符号率 / 停用词&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;L2 语言模型打分&lt;br/&gt;困惑度带通&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;L3 监督分类器&lt;br/&gt;教育分 / 质量分&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;L4 学习型选择器&lt;br/&gt;重要性重采样 / 逐样本决策&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;合格语料&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"候选文档\"] --&gt; B[\"L1 手工启发式&lt;br/&gt;长度 / 符号率 / 停用词\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"L2 语言模型打分&lt;br/&gt;困惑度带通\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"L3 监督分类器&lt;br/&gt;教育分 / 质量分\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"L4 学习型选择器&lt;br/&gt;重要性重采样 / 逐样本决策\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"合格语料\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>单文档成本</th>\n<th>可解释性</th>\n<th>典型风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 规则</td>\n<td>Gopher/C4 规则集、语言 ID</td>\n<td>微秒级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>文体偏见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 打分</td>\n<td>kenlm 困惑度带通</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>域外误杀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 分类器</td>\n<td>FineWeb-Edu、DCLM</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>标注偏差固化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 选择器</td>\n<td>DSIR、ask-LLM、QuRating</td>\n<td>十毫秒级以上</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>目标函数窄化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"启发式规则层-便宜-透明-有暗伤\">启发式规则层：便宜、透明、有暗伤</h2><p>Gopher 团队整理的规则集是这一层的教科书：文档长度上下限、平均词长、符号对词的比率、含字母字符的词占比、英文停用词比例、行尾省略号密度等十余条阈值（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2112.11446\">Gopher</a>）。C4 则贡献了更激进的变体——丢弃包含违禁词列表命中行的整篇页面、要求正文至少三句且以终结标点收尾（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1910.10683\">C4</a>）。这些规则至今仍在几乎所有管道里运行，因为它们几乎免费。暗伤在于规则的隐含文体假设：低停用词比例偏好正式书面语，于是方言写作、论坛口语、诗歌被系统性压低；符号率高会错杀代码与数学页面。规则层的设计者必须清楚：每一条阈值都是一次无声的编辑方针。</p>\n<h2 id=\"语言模型打分层-困惑度作为质量代理\">语言模型打分层：困惑度作为质量代理</h2><p>第二层引入统计语言模型给文档打分，CCNet 管道是标准范例：先按语言分流，再用各语言的 kenlm 模型计算困惑度，只保留中等偏低分数的文档——太高意味着乱码或外语混入，太低反而可能是重复模板（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1911.00359\">CCNet</a>）。困惑度的定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></munderover><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{PPL}(x) = \\exp\\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|}\\sum_{i=1}^{|x|} \\log p_\\theta(x_i \\mid x_{&lt;i})\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">PPL</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 3600\"><path d=\"M863,9c0,-2,-2,-5,-6,-9c0,0,-17,0,-17,0c-12.7,0,-19.3,0.3,-20,1\nc-5.3,5.3,-10.3,11,-15,17c-242.7,294.7,-395.3,682,-458,1162c-21.3,163.3,-33.3,349,\n-36,557 l0,84c0.2,6,0,26,0,60c2,159.3,10,310.7,24,454c53.3,528,210,\n949.7,470,1265c4.7,6,9.7,11.7,15,17c0.7,0.7,7,1,19,1c0,0,18,0,18,0c4,-4,6,-7,6,-9\nc0,-2.7,-3.3,-8.7,-10,-18c-135.3,-192.7,-235.5,-414.3,-300.5,-665c-65,-250.7,-102.5,\n-544.7,-112.5,-882c-2,-104,-3,-167,-3,-189\nl0,-92c0,-162.7,5.7,-314,17,-454c20.7,-272,63.7,-513,129,-723c65.3,\n-210,155.3,-396.3,270,-559c6.7,-9.3,10,-15.3,10,-18z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.961em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.386em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 3600\"><path d=\"M76,0c-16.7,0,-25,3,-25,9c0,2,2,6.3,6,13c21.3,28.7,42.3,60.3,\n63,95c96.7,156.7,172.8,332.5,228.5,527.5c55.7,195,92.8,416.5,111.5,664.5\nc11.3,139.3,17,290.7,17,454c0,28,1.7,43,3.3,45l0,9\nc-3,4,-3.3,16.7,-3.3,38c0,162,-5.7,313.7,-17,455c-18.7,248,-55.8,469.3,-111.5,664\nc-55.7,194.7,-131.8,370.3,-228.5,527c-20.7,34.7,-41.7,66.3,-63,95c-2,3.3,-4,7,-6,11\nc0,7.3,5.7,11,17,11c0,0,11,0,11,0c9.3,0,14.3,-0.3,15,-1c5.3,-5.3,10.3,-11,15,-17\nc242.7,-294.7,395.3,-681.7,458,-1161c21.3,-164.7,33.3,-350.7,36,-558\nl0,-144c-2,-159.3,-10,-310.7,-24,-454c-53.3,-528,-210,-949.7,\n-470,-1265c-4.7,-6,-9.7,-11.7,-15,-17c-0.7,-0.7,-6.7,-1,-18,-1z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它衡量的是&quot;这份文本在通用语言模型眼里有多意外&quot;。带通而非单调保留是其精髓：极低的困惑度常常对应样板文字。这一层的局限同样来自代理性质——领域专深但表述非常规的文本（法律判例文、古典文学）容易被误判为高困惑度垃圾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"神经分类器层-让大模型定义质量\">神经分类器层：让大模型定义质量</h2><p>第三层把&quot;什么是好文本&quot;的定义权交给强模型的标注。FineWeb-Edu 让大模型按教育价值打分，蒸馏出轻量分类器后以不同阈值切出多档子集，验证了&quot;分类器分数越高、下游知识与推理基准越好&quot;的单调关系；DCLM 项目用对比方式构造训练对——同一文档的原始版与人工改写版——训练出的分类器成为其基准线方案的核心（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.11794\">DataComp-LM</a>）。QuRating 把单一分数扩展为多维度评级（写作流畅、事实性、难度适配），用排序学习综合；ask-LLM 干脆让大模型逐样本回答&quot;该样本是否应进入训练集&quot;；DSIR 则不问绝对质量，只做重要性重采样，让语料的 n-gram 特征分布向目标分布（如维基或论文）对齐（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.03169\">DSIR</a>、<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.09739\">QuRating</a>、<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.09668\">ask-LLM</a>）。这一层的根本风险是<strong>定义权垄断</strong>：标注模型自己的偏见会原样烙进语料，而且整个过程缺乏可申诉性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过滤的计算经济学-强度不是免费的\">过滤的计算经济学：强度不是免费的</h2><p>激进过滤的收益边界正在被量化。Xie 等人的数据过滤扩展律发现，在小算力下调优出的过滤器配置搬到大规模训练时会失效——过滤增益无法跨算力尺度平移（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.07177\">Scaling Laws for Data Filtering</a>）；Nemotron-CC 团队则指出 FineWeb-Edu 与 DCLM 式的激进过滤以丢弃九成数据为代价，损害了长 token 预算下的可用总量，并给出组合解法：多分类器集成降低单点偏差，再用合成改写抢救边缘文档（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.02595\">Nemotron-CC</a>）。这些结果共同指向一个操作原则：<strong>过滤强度必须与训练 token 预算联合设计</strong>。预算小时尽管激进，反正 token 用不完；预算拉满时，九成的丢弃率就是在烧钱。这也解释了为什么过滤阈值最终应该由<a href=\"../mixtures-curriculum/mixture-design\">混合设计与配比实验</a>统一调度，而不是清洗团队单独拍板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻环节的协作\">与相邻环节的协作</h2><p>过滤器不是孤岛。它与<a href=\"deduplication\">去重</a>存在明确的顺序依赖——签名去重在干净语料上信噪比更高，所以惯例是先粗滤再去重；反过来去重的输出又会改变过滤器的校准集构成。当语料中混入<a href=\"../mixtures-curriculum/synthetic-in-pretraining\">合成数据</a>时，过滤器还要承担守门员职责：合成流的方差远小于自然文本，若无独立阈值的通道控制，模型打分会系统性地偏爱模型生成的文本，形成自我强化回路。最后别忘了评测污染检测同样依赖打分基础设施，两套系统的阈值需要分开审计。</p>\n<p>校准集的治理是贯穿所有层级的地基问题。分类器的训练标注、阈值的人工抽检、误杀样本的申诉复核，都依赖一份有代表性的校准集——而它本身也会漂移：语料构成每变一次，旧的校准集就偏离新分布一步。实践中的最低配置是按来源与语言分层的固定抽样框，配合周期性人工复标；更高的配置是把人工复核做成常设流水线，让每个过滤器版本都带着自己的混淆矩阵上线。没有这层地基，前面所有关于阈值的讨论都只是空中楼阁。</p>\n<p>把过滤器上线路径压缩成三步：规则层兜底先行，为后续所有层提供干净起点；分类器阈值按下游基准定档而非直觉拍板；校准集分层抽样并周期复标，让每个版本自带混淆矩阵。三步走完，过滤器才算可审计的组件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>质量过滤已从手工规则演进到大模型标注驱动的分类器，判别力上升而可解释性与多样性保护在退化。</li>\n<li>规则层管底线、困惑度层管异常、分类器层管增益、选择器层管定向——四层各司其职而非互相替代。</li>\n<li>过滤强度必须与数据预算和训练尺度联合优化；九成丢弃率是妙手还是豪赌，取决于你还剩多少 token 可花。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"质量过滤：从启发式到模型打分","id":"质量过滤-从启发式到模型打分"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"启发式规则层：便宜、透明、有暗伤","id":"启发式规则层-便宜-透明-有暗伤"},{"level":2,"text":"语言模型打分层：困惑度作为质量代理","id":"语言模型打分层-困惑度作为质量代理"},{"level":2,"text":"神经分类器层：让大模型定义质量","id":"神经分类器层-让大模型定义质量"},{"level":2,"text":"过滤的计算经济学：强度不是免费的","id":"过滤的计算经济学-强度不是免费的"},{"level":2,"text":"与相邻环节的协作","id":"与相邻环节的协作"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"去重：精确、模糊与语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/pretraining-data-engineering/cleaning-filtering/deduplication"},"next":{"title":"评测去污染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/pretraining-data-engineering/cleaning-filtering/benchmark-decontamination"}}